<https://register.ld.admin.ch/termdat/109117> <http://schema.org/name> "irresponsabilit\u00E9 absolue"@fr .
<https://register.ld.admin.ch/termdat/109117> <http://schema.org/citation> "L'Assembl\u00E9e f\u00E9d\u00E9rale, 1984, p. 28"@fr .
<https://register.ld.admin.ch/termdat/109117> <http://schema.org/description> "Privil\u00E8ge parlementaire selon lequel un d\u00E9put\u00E9 f\u00E9d\u00E9ral ne peut \u00EAtre tenu responsable pour les opinions qu'il \u00E9met au sein de l'Assembl\u00E9e f\u00E9d\u00E9rale ou de ses commissions."@fr .
<https://register.ld.admin.ch/termdat/109117> <http://schema.org/name> "irresponsabilit\u00E0 assoluta"@it .
<https://register.ld.admin.ch/termdat/109117> <http://schema.org/citation> "L'Assemblea federale, 1984, p. 28"@it .
<https://register.ld.admin.ch/termdat/109117> <http://schema.org/description> "Privilegio parlamentare secondo il quale i deputati federali non possono essere chiamati a rispondere dei pareri da loro espressi in seno all'Assemblea federale o alle sue commissioni."@it .
<https://register.ld.admin.ch/termdat/109117> <http://schema.org/name> "absolute immunity"@en .
<https://register.ld.admin.ch/termdat/109117> <http://schema.org/citation> "The Swiss Federal Assembly, 1984, p. 30"@en .
<https://register.ld.admin.ch/termdat/109117> <http://schema.org/description> "Parliamentary privilege which says that no representative of the Swiss Federal Assembly is liable to criminal or civil sanctions for any opinion he expresses during council sessions."@en .
